     "e6b33c78-ac22-49c0-a9f3-0500f444493b"], Cell["\<\
Parallel lines are those in a plane which do not meet, however far produced.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"432588b4-0380-4c99-a2a9-22f4ed3552c7"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "f5b6873e-d3da-4b76-8505-f8fb82d26f1d"], Cell[
