Playfair's axiom: exactly one parallel through a point off the line.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"5582dfef-14d2-4031-81d8-cc5e0f7fed18"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
