    "Euclid's axiom, stated with betweenness and equidistance.", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"85a7e518-5bec-4d8e-8218-345486a3e96e"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"8a4f0d0d-cb27-477a-81c8-\
